! Detailed Chemical Kinetics Model for the Autoignition of Diethyl Ether
! Contact: Yasuyuki Sakai, E-mail:y_sakai@u-fukui.ac.jp
!
! Revision history
!
! [1] 2015/12/03 first release
!     DEE sub-mechanism based on the papers of Sakai
!         Y. Sakai, Proc. Combust. Inst. 35 (2015) 161-169
!         Y. Sakai, submitted to 36th International Symposium on Combustion
!     C0-C4 base reaction mechanism taken from the papers of Burke.
!         S.M. Burke, Combust. Flame 162 (2015) 296-314
!         S.M. Burke, Combust. Flame 161 (2014) 2765-2784
!         remove the reactions of C5, C6, and C7 species
!
!-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
THERMO
